## Script: Auto-Skin all mobs & toss ribs
## Created by: oakman8490#0
#############################################

# Oaks [KoU] Auto-Skinning Snippet
# To be placed inside your looping background script, will automatically skin all mob corpses blue or grey.
# Will also toss any unwanted ribs you pick up in the next corpse you skin.
# FYI - You will not go grey for skinning a blue corpse, or for putting ribs on it. Only if you take something off the corpse.


### "Intro" - Placed before your loop starts. (typically before: while not dead)

# 1 = on , 0 = off
setvar autoSkinning 1
setvar autoTossRibs 1

if not listexists skinnedCorpses
    createlist skinnedCorpses
endif
clearlist skinnedCorpses

### "/Intro"


/////----------\\\\\


### "Loop" - Placed inside your loop (typically inside the loop: while not dead)

    @ignore! skinnedCorpses
    if autoSkinning = 1 and not hidden and findtype "Elven Spellblade" backpack and findtype 8198 ground -1 -1 2 as Acorpse
        getlabel Acorpse AcorpseLabel
        if "the remains" in AcorpseLabel
            // Player Corpse
        else
            while not targetexists 
                useskill 'forensicevaluation'
            endwhile
            if targetexists 
                target Acorpse
            endif
            if autoTossRibs = 1 and findtype 2545 backpack as McRibs
                lift McRibs 60000
                drop Acorpse
            endif
        endif
        pushlist skinnedCorpses Acorpse
    endif  

### "/Loop"